&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spring.io/guides/tutorials/spring-boot-kotlin/&quot; class=&quot;bare&quot;&gt;https://spring.io/guides/tutorials/spring-boot-kotlin/&lt;/a&gt;[&lt;mark&gt;#&lt;/mark&gt; Integrazione Gradle&lt;/p&gt;
