&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_diagramma_delle_classi_modelli_cicd&quot;&gt;Diagramma delle classi - Modelli CI/CD&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;images/diag-plantuml-md5-17c128b8b33835d9e11d7dece1edd995.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;814&quot; height=&quot;635&quot;&gt;
