&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i_pattern_di_progettazione_gof_in_python&quot;&gt;I pattern di progettazione GoF in Python&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/whikwon/python-patterns/&quot;&gt;implementazione 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Sean-Bradley/Design-Patterns-In-Python&quot;&gt;implementazione 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sbcode.net/python/&quot;&gt;libro completo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I design pattern di GoF sono un insieme di 23 design pattern che sono stati descritti nel libro &quot;Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
